The next piece is especially important because DGLab's runtime isn't a conventional PHP deployment. It uses:

**Caddy → Tengine → FrankenPHP → persistent workers → Fibers**

and the repository calls this the **Anvil three-tier deployment stack**. ([GitHub](https://github.com/DGCodeIdeas/DGLab))
I'll analyze whether that topology is justified, its failure modes, scaling model, health checks, deployment/rollback behavior, and whether Tengine is actually earning its place between Caddy and FrankenPHP.

