# 5.11 Gap #10 — Testing strategy

The project should have four distinct testing layers.

```text id="h2s8rm"
                ┌──────────────────────┐
                │   Architecture tests │
                └──────────┬───────────┘
                           │
                ┌──────────▼───────────┐
                │   Integration tests  │
                └──────────┬───────────┘
                           │
                ┌──────────▼───────────┐
