# Verification Report — DGLab Architecture Review

I cross-checked every specific factual claim in the architect's review against the actual repository at `main` HEAD (`a4a3402`). Verdict legend: ✅ **Confirmed** (matches repo) · ⚠️ **Outdated** (was true earlier, repo moved) · ❌ **Wrong** (doesn't match repo) · 💬 **Opinion** (engineering judgment, not a fact-checkable claim).

