The README simultaneously claims (a) all 8 Milestone-0 blueprints shipped and the project is post-MUWV, (b) only 5 of 8 shipped and pre-MUWV, and (c) those 4 blueprints are "Not started" while also being "Complete." `public/index.php` is described as both a real implementation and a "503 placeholder." The architect's "documentation/state drift" finding is **understated**.

### Worker/request state separation (WeakMap<Fiber, …>)
✅ **Confirmed.** `packages/core/container/src/Container.php` lines 13, 65, 84 explicitly declare `WeakMap<Fiber, array<string, mixed>> $pulseInstances` and `WeakMap<Fiber, …> $fiberResolving`. Line 55: "WeakMap<Fiber, array<string, mixed>> — when a Fiber is garbage-collected, PHP automatically evicts its entries." ADR-017 ("Fiber-based cooperative runtime") is the binding ADR.

