Same protocol — every specific factual claim cross-checked against the actual repo. Verdict legend: ✅ **Confirmed** · ⚠️ **Outdated/Partial** · ❌ **Wrong** · 💬 **Sound Opinion** · ✅❌ **Partially Right** (claim has both true and false elements).

