The diagram is correct as **target-state**. The SPEC should label it as such — otherwise a contractor might verify Hub currently depends on DBAL (which would fail) and conclude the architecture is broken.

### ⚠️ 2. `->resolve(` in the forbidden-pattern set produces false positives

The pattern IS used legitimately in production code as domain-specific resolvers, not as a service-locator anti-pattern:
