## §33. Release Verification Checks

### 10-item release verification list
💬 **Sound — comprehensive and well-ordered.** The 10 items cover:
1-2. Liveness + readiness (the M10 split)
3. Representative application request (not just `/health`)
4-5. Request/trace ID propagation (the M06 contract)
6. No internal error leakage (§27 discipline)
7. Middleware/controller path execution
8-9. Architecture fitness checks + forbidden dependency edges (the M01 contract)
10. Post-verification health

The list correctly sequences "static checks first, dynamic checks second, post-switch monitoring third."

### "A failed verification MUST prevent traffic switching."
💬 **Critical.** This is the hard gate that turns the smoke test from "advisory" to "blocking."

