## §34. Blue/Green Rollback

### "Rollback MUST NOT require rebuilding the previous release."
💬 **Sound.** This is the key property of immutable-artifact deployment. The existing blue/green infra (`anvil-frankenphp@.service` template unit `%i = blue|green` + `lib/deploy.sh` + `__ANVIL_CURRENT_SYMLINK__`) already supports this — rollback = swap symlink back.

### "The deployment system SHOULD retain enough artifact metadata to identify the previous known-good version deterministically."
💬 **Sound — and currently a gap.** The symlink swap exists but I haven't seen explicit "previous known-good" metadata retention. The SPEC's "SHOULD" framing correctly identifies this as a gap to close.

