## §38. Implementation Principles (4 classifications)

💬 **Sound taxonomy.** CURRENT STATE / EXTEND EXISTING / INTRODUCE NEW / FUTURE/DEFERRED matches the "preserve vs extend vs introduce vs defer" discipline that has run consistently through all 12 verification areas. The rule "Contractors MUST NOT rebuild capabilities listed as CURRENT STATE" is the right defensive discipline.

