## §40. Phase 1 — Enforce Ring Boundaries

### "Implement an AST/import-based dependency checker"
💬 **Sound — and matches M01/REQ-TEST-002.** The forbidden-direction table maps exactly to ADR-004 tier-enforcement DAG. The exempt carve-out for "repository root/application composition boundary" is correct — `public/index.php` and the future `ApplicationFactory` are intentionally omniscient.

### "The checker MUST report: source file, source ring, target ring, import, rule violated"
💬 **Sound failure-message format.** Matches what I recommended in Area 5 Gap #1.

