## §43. Worker Contamination Tests

### The 6-test minimum
💬 **Sound — matches REQ-TEST-003/M04.** The 6 tests (sequential requests on one worker, nested Fiber execution, interleaved Fibers, exception during request, request termination, repeated worker reuse) cover the persistent-worker bug class comprehensively.

### "Acceptance: Zero cross-request contamination."
💬 **Critical hard gate.** This is the right invariant — any non-zero result indicates a runtime architecture defect, not a flaky test.

