## §44. Phase 3 — Composition Root

### "Move the composition currently performed by `public/index.php` into an `ApplicationFactory`"
✅ **Sound — matches M02/REQ-APP-002.** The PlantUML diagram correctly shows `ApplicationFactory` outside Core, depending on Container + Core Services + Hub Services + Spoke Services, with Kernel as the runtime entry point.

### "The factory MUST NOT become a service locator."
💬 **Critical discipline.** Prevents the common anti-pattern where the factory becomes a god object that resolves services on demand. The factory should compose at boot, not resolve at runtime.

### "Core remains unaware of application composition."
✅ **Critical invariant.** This is the same rule as REQ-APP-001 — Core MUST NOT become aware of application-specific implementations.

