💬 **Sound — matches M10/REQ-OPS-001.** The note "Use the existing `/health` endpoint as a compatibility path during migration if necessary" is the right migration discipline — prevents breaking existing monitoring while the three-tier split is rolled out.

### "Extend `deploy-smoke.sh` or introduce a dedicated release-verification script rather than replacing existing deployment infrastructure."
💬 **Critical "extend don't rebuild" discipline.** This is the same pattern as M05 (preserve existing Kernel lifecycle tests) — extend the existing smoke test rather than introducing a parallel verification system.

