- [ ] Positive and negative fixture tests exist for each check.
- [ ] CI executes all three checks.
- [ ] Current `main` passes all three checks.
- [ ] No production implementation is modified by this deliverable.
- [ ] Fitness-function results are recorded as evidence for SDLC recalibration.

### Explicit Non-Goals

Deliverable 3 does **not**:

- fix any P0/P1/P2 findings from Task 69;
- implement Showcase/LMS functionality;
- harden JWT;
- modify RequestContext;
- modify Filesystem;
