BUILD THROUGHPUT
1 → 2
2.5 work uni([GitHub](https://github.com/DGCodeIdeas/DGLab/blob/main/Architecture/CrossCutting/SDLC-AGRD.md))       └── measured

DEEPENING THROUGHPUT
