# 15. Finally, integrate this into SDLC

This is the most important architectural consequence.

Every Lap should begin with:

```text
1. Generate current architecture state
2. Compare against previous state
3. Classify drift
4. Reconcile intentional changes
5. Freeze admission graph
6. Begin work
```

And every Lap should end with:

```text
1. Generate architecture state
2. Run fitness functions
3. Reconcile findings
4. Update generated documentation
5. Record SDLC evidence
6. Enter cooldown
```

That makes the architecture lifecycle:

```text
                ┌───────────────────┐
                │   Source +        │
                │   Composer        │
                └─────────┬─────────┘
                          │
                          ▼
                ┌───────────────────┐
                │ Architecture      │
                │ State Generator   │
                └─────────┬─────────┘
